              "title": "Money Words",
              "weight": 1,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700006001000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aA1bB2cC3d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Let's learn the words for <b>money</b> in English:\"}},{\"id\":\"dD4eE5fF6g\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>coin</b> — монета\",\"<b>banknote / bill</b> — купюра\",\"<b>penny</b> — пенни (1 цент)\",\"<b>nickel</b> — 5 центов\",\"<b>dime</b> — 10 центов\",\"<b>quarter</b> — 25 центов\",\"<b>dollar ($)</b> — доллар\",\"<b>pound (£)</b> — фунт (UK)\",\"<b>euro (€)</b> — евро\",\"<b>cent</b> — цент\"]}},{\"id\":\"gG7hH8iI9j\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We write prices like this: <b>$5.99</b> (five dollars and ninety-nine cents).\"}},{\"id\":\"jJ0kK1lL2m\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We say: <em>It costs <b>five dollars ninety-nine</b>.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "It costs five dollars and ninety-nine cents.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
