            {
              "title": "Asking About Prices",
              "weight": 4,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700006004000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"wW9xX0yY1z\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To ask about the price of something in a shop, use these phrases:\"}},{\"id\":\"zA2bB3cC4d\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>How much is this?</b> — Сколько это стоит?\",\"<b>How much does it cost?</b> — Сколько это стоит?\",\"<b>What is the price?</b> — Какова цена?\",\"<b>Is it on sale?</b> — Это на распродаже?\",\"<b>Do you have anything cheaper?</b> — У вас есть что-нибудь дешевле?\"]}},{\"id\":\"dD5eE6fF7g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"The seller might answer:\"}},{\"id\":\"gG8hH9iI0j\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<em>It's <b>$15</b>.</em>\",\"<em>That costs <b>twenty dollars</b>.</em>\",\"<em>It's on <b>sale</b> — 50% off!</em>\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "How much is this jacket? It costs forty-nine dollars.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
