        {
          "title": "3.1 In the Shop",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "title": "Common Shopping Expressions",
              "weight": 5,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700006005000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"jJ1kK2lL3m\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Here are the most useful phrases for shopping:\"}},{\"id\":\"mM4nN5oO6p\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Customer (покупатель):</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"pP7qQ8rR9s\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Can I help you?</b> — Могу я вам помочь? (seller says this)\",\"<b>I'm just looking, thanks.</b> — Я просто смотрю, спасибо.\",\"<b>I'm looking for...</b> — Я ищу...\",\"<b>Do you have...?</b> — У вас есть...?\",\"<b>I'll take it.</b> — Я возьму это.\",\"<b>I'll take two, please.</b> — Я возьму два, пожалуйста.\"]}},{\"id\":\"sS0tT1uU2v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Seller (продавец):</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"vV3wW4xX5y\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Here you are.</b> — Пожалуйста (вот).\",\"<b>Will that be all?</b> — Это всё?\",\"<b>That comes to $12.</b> — Итого $12.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "I'm looking for a bag. Do you have a black one? I'll take it!",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "matching",
                  "pairs": [
                    {
