            {
              "title": "Buying and Declining",
              "weight": 6,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700006006000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yY6zZ7aA8b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Sometimes we want to buy something. Sometimes we don't. Here is how to say both:\"}},{\"id\":\"bB9cC0dD1e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>To buy:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"eE2fF3gG4h\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I'll take this one. — Я возьму этот.\",\"I'll buy two of these. — Я куплю два.\",\"Can I pay by card? — Могу я заплатить картой?\"]}},{\"id\":\"hH5iI6jJ7k\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>To decline (отказаться):</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"kK8lL9mM0n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"No, thank you. — Нет, спасибо.\",\"It's too expensive. — Слишком дорого.\",\"I'll think about it. — Я подумаю.\",\"Maybe next time. — Может, в следующий раз.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "It's too expensive. I'll think about it. Maybe next time.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
